          "name": "Atopos rugosus Collinge, 1902",
          "rank": "SPECIES",
          "commonName": "",
          "lineage": "Atopos",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "<p>Collinge (1902) original descriptions on <em>Atopos rugosus</em> – “Colour of notum, dark green with yellowish-brown spots, granulate the extreme anterior portion of the notum is almost white, while posteriorly the body is sharply pointed; underside (perinotum?) yellowish, foot-sole dirty yellow; keel fairly well developed, yellowish brown colour.”</p>",
